In collaboration with the medical team, we have made significant progress on the Enhanced Patient Care Platform. Our focus has been on refining the electronic health record (EHR) integration, and we have successfully achieved the following milestones:

* Implemented seamless data transfer between the EHR system and the platform
* Integrated a user-friendly interface for healthcare professionals to access patient information
